  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/0f1cc7e2af17f6d1f0cf68511e78712a2ca91f125e24da67acd567dc28b994ed.png] \n\nGiven: 22 * 110 * 392 * 49 * 18 * 12\n\nOption 1) +, ÷, =, –, ×\n\nAfter putting all mathematical sign in given equation we get:\n\n⇒ 22 + __**110 ÷ 392**__ = 49 - __**18 × 12**__\n\n⇒ __**22 + 0.280**__ = __**49 - 288**__\n\n⇒ 22.28 ≠ - 239\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 2) +, =, ÷, ×, –\n\nAfter putting all mathematical sign in given equation we get:\n\n⇒ __**22 + 110**__ = __**392 ÷ 49**__ × 18 - 12 \n\n⇒ 132 = __**8 × **____**18**__ - 12\n\n⇒ 132 = __**144 - 12**__\n\n⇒ 132 = 132\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) =, –, +, ÷, ×\n\nAfter putting all mathematical sign in given equation we get:\n\n⇒ 22 = 110 - 392 + __**49 ÷ 18 **__× 12 \n\n⇒ 22 = 110 - 392 + __**2.722 × 12**__\n\n⇒ 22 = __**110**__ - 392 __**+ 32.664**__\n\n⇒ 22 = __**142.664 - 392 **__\n\n⇒ 22 = - 249.33\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 4) =, ×, +, ÷, – \n\nAfter putting all mathematical sign in given equation we get:\n\n⇒ 22 = 110 × 392 + __**49 ÷ 18**__ - 12\n\n⇒ 22 = __**110 × 392**__ + 2.722 - 12\n\n⇒ 22 = __**43,120 + 2.722** __- 12\n\n⇒ 22 = 43,122.722 - 12\n\n⇒ 22 ≠ 43,110.722\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"+, =, ÷, ×, –**\".",
